      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-26T02:49:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On BackerKit: Every time I try to log in there, I get confused by the difference between the project creator accounts (which have a prominently displayed login) and the project backer accounts (which you have to dig for). Are you logging in to the correct one?</p><p>On OblivAeon: you may have an open preorder without having backed it on Kickstarter; I believe the preorder options were option for a while after the Kickstarter ended. But of course you want to check the details...</p><p>I was charged for backing OblivAeon on Feb. 9, 2016. But you may have been charged after that if you went through the preorders.</p>",
